cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "FMDV serotype A vaccine matching: machine learning prediction from VP1 sequences"
abstract: >-
  A Boruta-selected Random Forest classifier that predicts binary vaccine matching
  (r1 >= 0.3) for foot-and-mouth disease virus serotype A from VP1 amino acid
  sequences, together with the curated virus-antiserum dataset, analysis pipeline
  and web application.
